#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>I-Bandwidth:</strong> Seta umthamo osetyenziselwa ukubala ukusetyenziswa, umzekelo i-100M okanye i-1G. U-K, M, G kunye no-T bayaxhaswa. Khetha Iyafana no-&quot;Ngena&quot; xa zombini izikhokelo zinomthamo olinganayo.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ujongano lwetrefikhi:</strong> Khangela ngesixhobo, iphothi okanye inkcazo, okanye khetha u-Khangela konke. Khetha ujongano, uze ucofe u-Sebenzisa ujongano ukuze usete umthombo olinganisiweyo ophambili, indawo yokuya ekucofweni kunye negrafu yokuhova engundoqo. Imithombo elinganisiweyo eyongezelelweyo neegrafu zokuhova ziyagcinwa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Imbonakalo neenkcazo:</strong> Isimbo Sendawo Yokudlula silawula amagophe agobileyo okanye anengalo; Ububanzi beKhonkco bulawula ukutyeba kotolo. Inkcazo yoNGENA kunye neNkcazo yoPHUMA zongeza umbhalo kwicala ngalinye. Ipesenti iseta indawo yombhalo ecaleni kwekhonkco. Isimbo seNkcazo sibeka iinkcazo ecaleni kwekhonkco (Ecaleni) okanye phezu kotolo (Embindini); Sebenzisa okungagqibekanga kwemephu ilandela Isimbo seMephu.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Iigrafu zokuhova ezongezelelweyo:</strong> Bonisa ubuninzi beegrafu zokuhova ezimbini: igrafu yetrefikhi engundoqo kunye nenye eyongezelelweyo, efana ne-CPU, ukubambezeleka okanye olunye ujongano. Hluza ngokohlobo lwegrafu inciphisa ukhetho. Yongeza igrafu yokuhova yongeza eyongezelelweyo; Tshintsha iigrafu zokuhova iyayiguqula; Susa igrafu iyayisusa. Igrafu yetrefikhi engundoqo, itrefikhi elinganisiweyo nendawo yokuya ekucofweni kwekhonkco zihlala zingatshintshanga. Kumjongi, umboniso ngamnye we-Cacti uvula igrafu yawo epheleleyo xa ucofiwe.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Iisetingi eziphucukileyo:</strong> Izilawuli ezinganyanzelekanga zokushenxisa iileyibhile zetrefikhi ze-NGENA/PHUMA, ukudibanisa imithombo elinganisiweyo, ukutshintsha indawo yokuya ekucofweni kunye nokufaka ii-URL zemifanekiso yokuhova ngokwezifiso. Iindawo zeeleyibhile zetrefikhi zishenxisa iibhokisi zokusetyenziswa ecaleni kwekhonkco, ngokuzimeleyo kwiindawo zeenkcazo. Sebenzisa okungagqibekanga kwemephu ilandela Isimbo seMephu. Ikhonkco letrefikhi eliqhelekileyo alifane lifune utshintsho apha.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Ukudibanisa imithombo yetrefikhi:</strong> Yongeza umthombo wetrefikhi yongeza olunye ujongano kwisixa semephu, ngokwahlukeneyo ku-NGENA naku-PHUMA. Susa umthombo isusa umthombo owongezelelweyo. Tshintsha umthombo ophambili usebenzisa u-Sebenzisa ujongano phezulu. Itrefikhi edityanisiweyo ithelekiswa ne-bandwidth eqwalaselweyo ukuze kubalwe ukusetyenziswa. Akukho grafu ye-Cacti edityanisiweyo eyenziwa ngokuzenzekelayo; yenza igrafu edibeneyo ehambelanayo kwi-Cacti uze ufake ii-URL zayo zokucofa nezokuhova ukuba ziyimfuneko. Amakhonkco emephu ahlukeneyo adla ngokucaca ngakumbi kuqhagamshelwano oluphambili nolokuxhasa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Imithombo yesandla nee-URL:</strong> Ibhokisi yombhalo yomthombo ihlela uluhlu olupheleleyo lwemithombo elinganisiweyo, kubandakanya umthombo ophambili. I-URL yendawo yokuya ekucofweni ilawula apho ukucofa ikhonkco lemephu kuya khona. I-URL yegrafu yokuhova engundoqo iseta umboniso wangaphambili wokuqala; Ii-URL zegrafu eyongezelelweyo zamkela i-URL enye yomfanekiso eyongezelelweyo. Le yongezelelweyo ikwalawulwa phantsi ko-Iigrafu zokuhova ezongezelelweyo.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Lungelelanisa kunye neNdawo yokudlula:</strong> Lungelelanisa ihlengahlengisa ubeko lwekhonkco. Indawo yokudlula ikuvumela ukuba ubeke indawo yokugoba kwimephu.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hlela Uqwalaselo Olungahluzwanga:</strong> Hlela isintaksi yemephu engaphantsi ukuze ufumane iisetingi ezingaphaya kwale fom.</p>"

